          "type": "om_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who We Are",
            "content": "Urban Pots Australia is a proud family owned business based in Sydney, dedicated to delivering quality, stylish, and custom planter solutions across the city and greater New South Wales. From everyday homes to large commercial and urban development projects, we provide planters tailored to meet the unique needs of Sydney’s diverse landscapes.\n\nWe began by importing designer planters that add elegance to residential gardens and have expanded to craft custom planter boxes made right here in our Sydney yard. Whether you’re looking for unique handcrafted planters for your home or durable scalable planter solutions for commercial developments, Urban Pots Australia has you covered.\n\nAs part of our commitment to Sydney’s landscaping and urban growth, we also operate Urban Landscape Supplies, offering a wide range of landscaping materials and products to complement our planter range. This enables us to support your project from concept to completion with expert advice, quality products, and personalised service.\n\nBeing a family owned business in Sydney means we take pride in every planter we create, ensuring it fits your style, space, and budget. From bespoke residential gardens to robust commercial installations, we combine craftsmanship and flexibility with a hands-on trusted approach to help you create vibrant, green spaces that enhance Sydney’s urban environment.",
